### Teste de Streaming - Firebird API

### 1. Status do streaming
GET http://localhost:8000/api/Streaming/status

### 2. Iniciar streaming
POST http://localhost:8000/api/Streaming/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connectionId": "desktop-cliente-01",
  "machineId": "DESKTOP-ABC123",
  "authToken": "seu-jwt-token-aqui"
}

### 3. Parar streaming
POST http://localhost:8000/api/Streaming/stop

### 4. Reiniciar streaming
POST http://localhost:8000/api/Streaming/restart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connectionId": "desktop-cliente-02",
  "machineId": "DESKTOP-ABC123",
  "authToken": "seu-jwt-token-aqui"
}

### 5. Status da API
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 6. Teste de conexão gRPC
GET http://localhost:8000/health/grpc

### Comandos que o cliente pode processar:
# GET_SYSTEM_INFO - Retorna informações do sistema
# GET_DATABASE_STATUS - Retorna status do banco de dados
# PING - Retorna pong com timestamp
